 "phrases": [
  {
   "start": 0.03,
   "end": 0.53,
   "text": "So,",
   "tags": [
    "excited"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 0.66,
   "end": 2.07,
   "text": "fast forward to today.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 2.27,
   "end": 3.83,
   "text": "Two thousand twenty-six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 4.05,
   "end": 4.63,
   "text": "Except here,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 4.63,
   "end": 6.96,
   "text": "they call it the year three hundred thousand,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 7.16,
   "end": 7.91,
   "text": "A.V.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 7.91,
   "end": 8.66,
   "text": "After Vroom.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 9.04,
   "end": 10.5,
   "text": "Here's what's different from your world.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 10.98,
   "end": 11.33,
   "text": "One.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 11.64,
   "end": 15.28,
   "text": "People here have been driving for almost three hundred thousand years.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 15.49,
   "end": 17.65,
   "text": "You've been driving for about one hundred and forty.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 18.11,
   "end": 18.43,
   "text": "Two.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 18.77,
   "end": 21.33,
   "text": "Every city on Earth is built around one road:",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 21.57,
   "end": 23.01,
   "text": "the Old Ostrich Road.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 23.2,
   "end": 24.55,
   "text": "The first road ever.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 24.78,
   "end": 25.95,
   "text": "It's a holiday route now.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 26.45,
   "end": 26.82,
   "text": "Three.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 27.13,
   "end": 29.4,
   "text": "The biggest sport on the planet isn't football.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 29.57,
   "end": 30.82,
   "text": "It's ostrich racing.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 30.96,
   "end": 34.1,
   "text": "And the ostrich still beats most cars off the line.",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 34.58,
   "end": 34.98,
   "text": "Four.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 35.3,
   "end": 37.02,
   "text": "Mammoths never went extinct.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 37.24,
   "end": 39.6,
   "text": "They pulled carts for fifty thousand years.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 39.82,
   "end": 41.2,
   "text": "Then cars took their jobs.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 41.42,
   "end": 42.29,
   "text": "Now they're retired,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 42.42,
   "end": 43.78,
   "text": "in giant nature parks.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 44.27,
   "end": 44.73,
   "text": "Five.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 45.05,
   "end": 49.64,
   "text": "Every car on Earth still has a cup holder in exactly the same place as the First Car.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 49.87,
   "end": 51.07,
   "text": "Nobody remembers why.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 51.43,
   "end": 51.93,
   "text": "Tradition.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 52.43,
   "end": 52.94,
   "text": "Six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 53.24,
   "end": 55.03,
   "text": "The word for \"hello\" is a honk.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.54,
   "end": 56.15,
   "text": "A short one.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 56.35,
   "end": 58.25,
   "text": "A long honk is very rude.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 58.73,
   "end": 59.21,
   "text": "Seven.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 59.47,
   "end": 61.79,
   "text": "The longest traffic jam in history lasted forty-one years.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 61.91,
   "end": 63.11,
   "text": "People were born in it.",
   "tags": [
    "deadpan"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.33,
   "end": 64.4,
   "text": "People got married in it.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 64.68,
   "end": 67.51,
   "text": "Somebody wrote a whole book about it.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 67.78,
   "end": 68.13,
   "text": "In it.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 68.69,
   "end": 69.01,
   "text": "Eight.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 69.3,
   "end": 72.62,
   "text": "Wheels are so old that nobody thinks of them as an invention.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 72.81,
   "end": 74.64,
   "text": "Asking \"who invented the wheel?\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 74.64,
   "end": 77.2,
   "text": "here is like asking \"who invented walking?\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 77.66,
   "end": 78.09,
   "text": "Nine.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 78.37,
   "end": 79.38,
   "text": "Speaking of walking:",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 79.52,
   "end": 81.1,
   "text": "it's an extreme sport now.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 81.27,
   "end": 84.15,
   "text": "Walking ten kilometers gets you on the news.",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 84.68,
   "end": 85.05,
   "text": "Ten.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 85.32,
   "end": 87.11,
   "text": "Nobody calls it a steering wheel.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 87.29,
   "end": 89.34,
   "text": "Everyone still calls it the round snake.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 89.85,
   "end": 91.17,
   "text": "Not everything is better,",
   "tags": [
    "deadpan"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.17,
   "end": 91.5,
   "text": "though.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.76,
   "end": 93.92,
   "text": "A third of the land is covered by roads.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 94.13,
   "end": 96.94,
   "text": "Wild animals live in special \"road-free zones.\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 97.16,
   "end": 100.32,
   "text": "And the air in some cities still smells like the black water.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 100.82,
   "end": 102.56,
   "text": "And maybe the biggest difference of all:",
   "tags": [
    "softly"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 102.83,
   "end": 105.61,
   "text": "the first thing the car taught humanity wasn't speed.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 105.93,
   "end": 108.52,
   "text": "It was that the people over the hill weren't monsters.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 108.83,
   "end": 109.63,
   "text": "They were neighbors.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  }
 ]
}